-- AND THERE ARE TWO SETS, BECAUSE THERE ARE TWO PIGS. `anchors` is the
-- primitives piggy -- a 6-stud ball centred at y 8.5 with cylinder legs --
-- and `meshAnchors` is the generated body, which is a different animal: two
